# Apptainer definition file for GeoCoT environment.
#
# BUILDTIME: Azure Linux 3.0 from MCR (mcr.microsoft.com).
#   MCR is HTTP 200 accessible from this environment.
#   Microsoft Container Registry does not have Docker Hub rate limits.
#   Docker v2 manifest verified: single 30MB layer.
#   Empty %post = no device creation = no nodev/fakeroot issues.
# RUNTIME: Job script installs Python + CUDA on compute node.

Bootstrap: docker
From: mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/base/core:3.0
